## What this plugin depends on

**`jev-governor`** — the decision layer this plugin calls. MIT licensed, by the same author.
<https://github.com/iamvazghen/jev-governor>

**Jev** — TypeSafe's System One model, a separately hosted service. When a user configures a
TypeSafe API key, decisions are made by that service and the request leaves the user's
machine. Use of it is subject to [TypeSafe's terms](https://docs.typesafe.ai/legal) and
[privacy policy](https://docs.typesafe.ai/legal/privacy-policy). This plugin distributes no
model weights, no API keys and no usage credits.

Without a configured key, the plugin uses the offline rules baseline that ships inside
`jev-governor`. That path makes no network request of any kind.

## Third-party code

None. The plugin has no runtime dependencies of its own beyond the Python standard library,
and the decision layer has one dependency (`httpx`).

## Trademarks

**Jev**, **TypeSafe**, **System One**, **Hermes** and **OpenClaw** are names of other
